  "en": {
   "깊은 홈 볼 베어링 | ILJIN 베어링": "Deep Groove Ball Bearings | ILJIN Bearing",
   "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Deep Groove Ball Bearings</p> <h2>깊은 홈 볼 베어링</h2> <p>경방향 하중 및 축방향 하중을 받을 수 있고, 고속용으로 사용 가능한 가장 보편적인 베어링입니다.</p> <p>개방형(Open Type), 실드형(Sealed Type: 접미기호 ZZ=금속씰, UU/DD=고무씰) 등이 공급됩니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>": "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Deep Groove Ball Bearings</p> <h2>Deep Groove Ball Bearings</h2> <p>These bearings can take both radial and axial loads and are suitable for high-speed use, making them the most common type of bearing.</p> <p>Available in Open Type and Sealed Type (suffix codes ZZ=metal seal, UU/DD=rubber seal), among others.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">You can search by entering just part of the model number or dimensions.</p>",
   "<p class=\"diagram-caption\">당사 SWS 카탈로그 규격 도면</p> <img src=\"img/deep_groove_ball.png\" alt=\"구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(내경) · D(외경) · 공차(d/D) · B(폭)</p> <p class=\"diagram-legend-tighter\">개방형(Open) · 실드형(ZZ/DD, Sealed)</p>": "<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Our SWS Catalog Spec Drawing</p> <img src=\"img/deep_groove_ball.png\" alt=\"Structural Cross-Section Diagram\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(Bore) · D(Outer Diameter) · Tolerance(d/D) · B(Width)</p> <p class=\"diagram-legend-tighter\">Open Type · Sealed Type (ZZ/DD)</p>",
